eviews</h2> <div className="space-y-4"> <blockquote className="bg-white p-4 rounded shadow-sm">"Lovely textures and great customer service." — A. Khan</blockquote> <blockquote className="bg-white p-4 rounded shadow-sm">"The wool coat is a statement piece. Highly recommend." — S. Ali</blockquote> </div> </section> )} {/* Order success */} {orderPlaced && ( <section className="mt-8 bg-[#efe6d9] p-6 rounded"> <h3 className="font-serif">Order {orderPlaced.id} placed</h3> <p className="text-sm">Total: {currency(orderPlaced.total)}</p> <p className="text-sm">Placed on: {new Date(orderPlaced.date).toLocaleString()}</p> </section> )} </main> {/* Footer */} <footer className="border-t bg-[#f3eadf] text-[#4b3e38] mt-10 py-8"> <div className="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4"> <div className="flex items-center gap-4"> <Logo className="h-10" /> <div> <div className="text-sm">Noor Collection</div> <div className="text-xs text-[#6b5a50]">Vintage tones · Timeless design</div> </div> </div> <div className="text-sm">© {new Date().getFullYear()} Noor Collection. All rights reserved.</div> </div> </footer> {/* Checkout Drawer / Modal */} {checkoutOpen && ( <div className="fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 flex items-end md:items-center justify-center z-40" onClick={()=>setCheckoutOpen(false)}> <div className="bg-white w-full md:max-w-2xl rounded-t-lg md:rounded-lg p-6 shadow-xl" onClick={(e)=>e.stopPropagation()}> <h3 className="text-xl font-serif mb-4">Cart</h3> {cart.length === 0 ? ( <div className="py-10 text-center">Your cart is empty.</div> ) : ( <div className="space-y-4"> {cart.map((c) => ( <div key={c.id} className="flex items-center gap-4"> <img src={c.img} alt={c.name} className="w-20 h-20 object-cover rounded" /> <div className="flex-1"> <div className="font-medium">{c.name}</div> <div className="text-sm text-[#6b5a50]">{currency(c.price)}</div> <div className="mt-2 flex items-center gap-2"> <button onClick={()=>updateQty(c.id, c.qty-1)} className="px-2 py-1 border rounded">-</button> <div className="px-3">{c.qty}</div> <button onClick={()=>updateQty(c.id, c.qty+1)} className="px-2 py-1 border rounded">+</button> <button onClick={()=>removeFromCart(c.id)} className="ml-4 text-sm">Remove</button> </div> </div> </div> ))} <div className="border-t pt-4"> <div className="flex items-center justify-between mb-2"><div>Subtotal</div><div>{currency(subtotal)}</div></div> <div className="flex items-center justify-between mb-2"><div>Shipping</div><div>{currency(shipping)}</div></div> <div className="flex items-center justify-between font-semibold text-lg"><div>Total</div><div>{currency(total)}</div></div> <div className="mt-4 flex gap-3"> <button onClick={()=>{ setCheckoutOpen(false); setView('shop'); }} className="px-4 py-2 border rounded">Continue shopping</button> <button onClick={()=>{ /* Open inline checkout form */ }} className="px-4 py-2 border rounded bg-[#efe6d9]" onClick={()=>{ setCheckoutOpen(true); /* stays open */ }}> Checkout </button> <button onClick={()=>{ // quick demo checkout: prompt for name/email const name = prompt('Name for order (demo)'); const email = prompt('Email for order (demo)'); if(name && email){ placeOrder({name,email}); } }} className="px-4 py-2 border rounded bg-[#7b6a5f] text-white">Place order (Demo)</button> </div> </div> </div> )} <div className="mt-4 text-right"> <button onClick={()=>setCheckoutOpen(false)} className="text-sm text-[#6b5a50]">Close</button> </div> </div> </div> )} </div> 

